# A face-down permanent has no mana cost, so its mana value is 0 (CR 708.2a) whatever the card is: Bot2 manifests dread
# from Turn Inside Out (the Elvish Mystic Bot1 bolts), putting Bringer of the Last Gift (mana value 8 face up) onto the
# battlefield face down. Against the Llanowar Elves (mana value 1) the face-down 2/2 ranks lowest, so Break Under Pressure
# makes Bot2 sacrifice the Elves, and the face-down creature stays.

